@POS_WMS_Host = http://localhost:5050

### 1. OpenAPI Specification Document
GET {{POS_WMS_Host}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Scalar API Documentation UI (Development Only)
GET {{POS_WMS_Host}}/scalar/v1
Accept: text/html

###

### 3. Login Template (Requires credentials via local environment variables)
# @name login
POST {{POS_WMS_Host}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{$dotenv %DEV_USER%}}",
  "password": "{{$dotenv %DEV_PASSWORD%}}"
}

###

### 4. Get Products (Using token variable placeholder)
@authToken = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

GET {{POS_WMS_Host}}/api/Products
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

###
